sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Alarm
  participant O as Operator
  participant S as System
  participant J as Journal
  participant P as PostMortem
  A->>O: freshness storm, refusal spike, trip
  O->>S: contain: halt entries, kill switch if needed
  S->>J: envelope snapshot of the moment
  J->>P: facts: rule values, inputs, actor
  P->>O: diagnosis + rule update proposal
  O->>O: human approves rule change, audited
